      "content": "You can't write a way forward when the only truth is the weight of it; Elias's performance is the only honest thing left.\nLet him break down instead of forcing a spark, because hope feels like a lie he can't afford to believe.\nThe most powerful story for him is the one where he stops pretending and finally lets the darkness take him.",
